    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/extras/c2f8d24a2d6a9955f94d8fac5ca82fdf.poster.avif?t=1745150213\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/extras/c2f8d24a2d6a9955f94d8fac5ca82fdf.webm?t=1745150213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/extras/c2f8d24a2d6a9955f94d8fac5ca82fdf.mp4?t=1745150213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey to the 17th century Caribbean and take the wheel of a ship as Captain George Somers, James Riskinner or Joseph Bannister, three historical figures\u00a0 during the &quot;Golden Age of Piracy&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/extras/52552622bf215b55dd6e856a6e3e4009.avif?t=1745150213\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each story is based at a different time, in a different settlement, from which you'll perform missions to upgrade your crew and ships.\u00a0\u00a0 Each mission pits you against enemy vessels in pursuit of parts or plunder in a classic Real-Time Strategy experience.\u00a0 Command up to six ships and engage in  real-time naval warfare and timed-turn-based combat  when boarding ships!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/extras/fbee911c67fb95a4526918a0cd415732.avif?t=1745150213\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >George Somers faces the challenges of preparing a new ship for an arduous journey to finally deliver supplies and settlers to Jamestown, ten months after a\u00a0 hurricane left him marooned in Bermuda.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >James Riskinner seeks to amass a fortune in Spanish gold and goods, taken by force, or you'll die trying.\u00a0 </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Joseph Bannister committed treachery against Britain and then sailed as a Privateer under the protection of the French, against the British.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/extras/bece718acb18226c26cbf55c7a815ab7.avif?t=1745150213\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/extras/c2f8d24a2d6a9955f94d8fac5ca82fdf.poster.avif?t=1745150213\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/extras/c2f8d24a2d6a9955f94d8fac5ca82fdf.webm?t=1745150213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/extras/c2f8d24a2d6a9955f94d8fac5ca82fdf.mp4?t=1745150213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey to the 17th century Caribbean and take the wheel of a ship as Captain George Somers, James Riskinner or Joseph Bannister, three historical figures\u00a0 during the &quot;Golden Age of Piracy&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/extras/52552622bf215b55dd6e856a6e3e4009.avif?t=1745150213\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each story is based at a different time, in a different settlement, from which you'll perform missions to upgrade your crew and ships.\u00a0\u00a0 Each mission pits you against enemy vessels in pursuit of parts or plunder in a classic Real-Time Strategy experience.\u00a0 Command up to six ships and engage in  real-time naval warfare and timed-turn-based combat  when boarding ships!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/extras/fbee911c67fb95a4526918a0cd415732.avif?t=1745150213\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >George Somers faces the challenges of preparing a new ship for an arduous journey to finally deliver supplies and settlers to Jamestown, ten months after a\u00a0 hurricane left him marooned in Bermuda.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >James Riskinner seeks to amass a fortune in Spanish gold and goods, taken by force, or you'll die trying.\u00a0 </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Joseph Bannister committed treachery against Britain and then sailed as a Privateer under the protection of the French, against the British.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/extras/bece718acb18226c26cbf55c7a815ab7.avif?t=1745150213\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Yarrrgh! Embark on adventure in three narrative-driven campaigns set in the Golden Age of Piracy. Engage and battle enemy ships in a classic RTS. Board and defeat enemy crews in turn-based combat as ships wage war around you! Upgrade your ships and crews! Battle enemy pirates!",
